keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - whole-genome sequencing
  - WGS
  - nextflow
  - germline variant calling
  - somatic variant calling
  - variant benchmarking
  - structural variants
  - reproducibility

abstract: >-
  A reproducible Nextflow DSL2 workflow for short-read human whole-genome
  variant analysis supporting germline and matched tumor-normal workflows,
  multi-caller evaluation, compact benchmarking, structural-variant analysis,
  coverage QC, optional CNV analysis, annotation, visualization, reporting,
  and provenance.